abstract: >-
  Zero-dependency Node.js CLI and library that compares two Kubernetes manifest snapshots, applies 19 versioned
  static rules, maps blast radius from the supplied manifests, summarises imported OpenTofu/Terraform plans without
  retaining state, and writes sealed Markdown, HTML and JSON reports. Its gate can only be BLOCKED or
  HUMAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED. Offline and read-only; it never deploys.
